{
    "word": "modulo",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "dc9a0fe5-945f-359f-8b0c-cd5dc0932c12",
                "word": "modulo",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6f0522f1-80b5-34b8-8f2f-85a2ca6cb8fc",
                        "entry_id": "dc9a0fe5-945f-359f-8b0c-cd5dc0932c12",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The operation or function that returns the remainder of one number divided by another."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": [
                    {
                        "linkage_id": "513d9fd5-9cac-4223-9b4e-fd9852f94584",
                        "source_entry_id": "dc9a0fe5-945f-359f-8b0c-cd5dc0932c12",
                        "source_sense_ids": [
                            "6f0522f1-80b5-34b8-8f2f-85a2ca6cb8fc"
                        ],
                        "linkage_type": "synonyms",
                        "word": "modulus"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "0640df73-1dad-3f4e-b30d-f5df82296fa4",
                "word": "modulo",
                "pos": "prep",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "001e084c-8604-3d65-b1f8-b83a5a0aff9d",
                        "entry_id": "0640df73-1dad-3f4e-b30d-f5df82296fa4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Given a specified modulus of."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "04d9db40-e1df-4156-b9d9-e592393f8b19",
                                "sense_id": "001e084c-8604-3d65-b1f8-b83a5a0aff9d",
                                "text": "21 and 84 are congruent to each other modulo 9, since both numbers leave the same remainder, 3, when divided by 9."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0fc1394-efee-4cad-bf03-f23cdd76fc2c",
                                "sense_id": "001e084c-8604-3d65-b1f8-b83a5a0aff9d",
                                "text": "Thus 21 modulo 9 is 3, because when 21 is divided by 9, the remainder is 3."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd52f3ba-ea4d-41b5-826f-f562a6c580d5",
                                "sense_id": "001e084c-8604-3d65-b1f8-b83a5a0aff9d",
                                "text": "21 is congruent to 3 modulo 9."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0d9e6b98-d17c-34f0-997b-7141a8289e6d",
                        "entry_id": "0640df73-1dad-3f4e-b30d-f5df82296fa4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Except for differences accounted for by."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7347b66d-7c4f-4de8-a618-cd1733cbdca6",
                                "sense_id": "0d9e6b98-d17c-34f0-997b-7141a8289e6d",
                                "text": "\"A is the same as B modulo C\" means A is the same as B except for differences accounted for by C."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "062976ff-eb3d-4e52-9eaa-cdf025230290",
                                "sense_id": "0d9e6b98-d17c-34f0-997b-7141a8289e6d",
                                "text": "Thus, the underlying structure which I would assign to Navajo will be identical, modulo word order, to the one that we found to be projected in all of the languages studied in chapter 3."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8354d55d-6a80-42fb-9bdc-106ba5971e9d",
                                "sense_id": "0d9e6b98-d17c-34f0-997b-7141a8289e6d",
                                "text": "Moreover, in the role of consumer, each individual (modulo his location) faces the same array of goods and services on sale to anyone who can pay the purchase price[.]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "35a9f112-c731-35a4-947e-2bd945ed5e8a",
                        "entry_id": "0640df73-1dad-3f4e-b30d-f5df82296fa4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "With due allowance for (a specified exception or particular detail)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5301edb7-37cb-42a9-8287-4de74ce34757",
                                "sense_id": "35a9f112-c731-35a4-947e-2bd945ed5e8a",
                                "text": "In the Lisp programming language, the \"tail recursion modulo cons\" technique allows functions that would be tail recursive but for a cons call to be transformed into a tail recursive form."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11a3d59f-811e-4fad-9c50-7de80ae450ea",
                                "sense_id": "35a9f112-c731-35a4-947e-2bd945ed5e8a",
                                "text": "All mammals, modulo the monotremes, give birth to live young."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8b1e990-8382-4c2d-b65b-dc41c5ea818d",
                                "sense_id": "35a9f112-c731-35a4-947e-2bd945ed5e8a",
                                "text": "I think it still holds up relatively well, modulo Joss Whedon's quirks, but a fuller version would probably have to include some more of the aftermath."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6087c587-e961-4587-b4bb-2536b80ff9bf",
                                "sense_id": "35a9f112-c731-35a4-947e-2bd945ed5e8a",
                                "text": "I recently upgraded my PC and bought a UHD monitor, but after installing Smite I realised that it is basically impossible to play it on a resolution bigger than 1080p, the reason being : basically everything modulo the HUD, does NOT scale with the resolution(everything from the minions to the ennemy^([sic]) health bar becomes tiny)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c4d84590-4e92-47fc-b0b4-35dbb67cee58",
                        "source_entry_id": "0640df73-1dad-3f4e-b30d-f5df82296fa4",
                        "source_sense_description": "Given a specified modulus of",
                        "target_lang_word": "modulo",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "modulo",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae5d434e-c78c-33f7-8ce2-647f83b9f57b",
                                        "entry_id": "ee883ee6-40d2-38f2-8ec2-f6bd854afa1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fonction mathématique donnant le reste de la division d’une variable par un nombre donné."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c688b59-e635-4bc6-8c4b-8b6b39b53621",
                                                "sense_id": "ae5d434e-c78c-33f7-8ce2-647f83b9f57b",
                                                "text": "Dans le cas de la fonction partie entière floor, le résultat est négatif pour un modulo avec un entier strictement négatif (en convenant de poser a mod -n = -(a mod n), par exemple 1 mod -2 = -1). Le modulo retourné est donc du même signe que le diviseur y."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "219a6969-facf-4213-bbf8-8d4259264acd",
                                                "sense_id": "ae5d434e-c78c-33f7-8ce2-647f83b9f57b",
                                                "text": "Serret en France, a ramené cette méthode à une étude de congruences […] relativement à un module qui est un polynôme premier construit sur le corps des résidus modulo P. — (Histoire générale des sciences, t.3, vol.1, 1961, page 72)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23f8ee58-8fcc-38c5-ae46-4190d69e138f",
                                        "entry_id": "ee883ee6-40d2-38f2-8ec2-f6bd854afa1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Non prise en compte (utilisé exclusivement comme apposition pour signifier « sans prendre en compte », « en négligeant », « à [ce qui suit] près » ; voir les exemples ci-après)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bf67ebf-f48c-4016-b64a-67b7f0406e70",
                                                "sense_id": "23f8ee58-8fcc-38c5-ae46-4190d69e138f",
                                                "text": "On arrive aux mêmes conclusions pour les pays limitrophes modulo la nature des biens exportés."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c19c03a-67ec-4fad-93c5-fa995ae81392",
                                                "sense_id": "23f8ee58-8fcc-38c5-ae46-4190d69e138f",
                                                "text": "En général, quand j’arrive chez moi après une longue marche, je ne suis pas mouillé modulo le temps qu’il a fait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1516d6d-184b-4fa6-a54e-f51b5ac65363",
                                                "sense_id": "23f8ee58-8fcc-38c5-ae46-4190d69e138f",
                                                "text": "Je vais arriver chez toi dans une heure modulo 5 à 10 minutes"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07492c11-8735-4d4f-9838-1e309927045c",
                        "source_entry_id": "0640df73-1dad-3f4e-b30d-f5df82296fa4",
                        "source_sense_description": "Given a specified modulus of",
                        "target_lang_word": "modulo",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "modulo",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68fec0f2-a297-338b-9f15-46d9ede76749",
                                        "entry_id": "14018618-31bb-38f9-967a-c11ddec1b914",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "äquivalent in Bezug auf das Ergebnis"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Präposition mit Genitiv",
                                            "mathematische Operation, Restklassenrechnung"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f00c308-0580-4065-a878-d0d0f3a59086",
                                                "sense_id": "68fec0f2-a297-338b-9f15-46d9ede76749",
                                                "text": "„Wie Modulo funktioniert, versteht man am schnellsten an konkreten Beispielen: 7 mod 2 (sprich 7modulo2) ist beispielsweise 1, denn 7 geteilt durch 2 lässt den Rest 1.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f1ebc4a-f8fd-4f0f-bd97-6a85026badee",
                                                "sense_id": "68fec0f2-a297-338b-9f15-46d9ede76749",
                                                "text": "„Zwei Zahlen sind kongruent (modulo der natürlichen Zahl n), wenn ihre Differenz durch n teilbar ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ce764f7-a207-428b-8c00-0c8032168fc2",
                                                "sense_id": "68fec0f2-a297-338b-9f15-46d9ede76749",
                                                "text": "Zwei Zahlen sind kongruent (modulo des Moduls m), wenn ihre Differenz durch m teilbar ist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b89783-3e68-4800-8cf0-4607a3dfc00d",
                                                "sense_id": "68fec0f2-a297-338b-9f15-46d9ede76749",
                                                "text": "„Die ganzen Zahlen zerfallen mit der Kongruenz also in Äquivalenzklassen, die Restklassen modulo m.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
